{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000001","text":"您好，请问在吗","intent":"greet","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000002","text":"嗨，早上好呀","intent":"greet","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000003","text":"你好，我是陈晨","intent":"greet","slots":[{"type":"name","start":5,"end":7}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000004","text":"哈喽，叫我Alex就行","intent":"greet","slots":[{"type":"name","start":5,"end":9}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000005","text":"没错，就是这样","intent":"affirm","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000006","text":"好的呀","intent":"affirm","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000007","text":"嗯，是的","intent":"affirm","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000008","text":"不对，搞错了","intent":"deny","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000009","text":"不是这样的","intent":"deny","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000010","text":"不对呀","intent":"deny","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000011","text":"能给我演示点什么功能吗","intent":"request_flow","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000012","text":"现在有哪些项目可以体验","intent":"request_flow","slots":[]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000013","text":"带我体验一下座舱影院吧","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"flow_ref","start":6,"end":10}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000014","text":"我想试试隐私车窗","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"flow_ref","start":4,"end":8}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000015","text":"把DLP车灯打开看看","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"flow_ref","start":1,"end":6}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000016","text":"我想体验车内的按摩座椅","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"part","start":4,"end":6},{"type":"flow_ref","start":7,"end":11}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000017","text":"先给我展示一下车内的功能","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"part","start":7,"end":9}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000018","text":"车外有什么功能可以看看","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"part","start":0,"end":2}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000019","text":"我想看看座舱里的配置演示","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"part","start":4,"end":7}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000020","text":"有什么适合全家的功能演示吗","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"theme","start":5,"end":7}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000021","text":"给我演示一下娱乐相关的项目","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"theme","start":6,"end":8}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000022","text":"我想看看车外关于隐私的功能","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"part","start":4,"end":6},{"type":"theme","start":8,"end":10}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000023","text":"座舱里有什么适合家庭的功能可以试","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"part","start":0,"end":3},{"type":"theme","start":8,"end":10}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000024","text":"帮我演示一下内饰的娱乐功能","intent":"request_flow","slots":[{"type":"part","start":6,"end":8},{"type":"theme","start":9,"end":11}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000025","text":"我叫王磊","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"name","start":2,"end":4}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000026","text":"你可以叫我小周","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"name","start":5,"end":7}]}
