{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000028","text":"就1号吧","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"choice","start":1,"end":3}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000029","text":"给我看看第3个","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"choice","start":4,"end":7}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000030","text":"车载影院吧","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"flow_ref","start":0,"end":4}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000031","text":"我对隐私玻璃比较感兴趣","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"flow_ref","start":2,"end":6}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000032","text":"我比较关注车外那部分","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"part","start":5,"end":7}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000033","text":"还是座舱里的吧","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"part","start":2,"end":5}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000034","text":"我更偏向家庭方向","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"theme","start":4,"end":6}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000035","text":"私密方面的吧","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"theme","start":0,"end":2}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000036","text":"我对车内的娱乐配置更感兴趣","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"part","start":2,"end":4},{"type":"theme","start":5,"end":7}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000037","text":"想选外饰里偏向隐私的那类","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"part","start":2,"end":4},{"type":"theme","start":7,"end":9}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000038","text":"我是林薇，比较想了解DLP大灯","intent":"inform","slots":[{"type":"name","start":2,"end":4},{"type":"flow_ref","start":10,"end":15}]}
{"record_id":"20261103T133326307652Z-01-000039","text":"先把这个演示暂停一下","intent":"request_stop","slots":[]}
